@startuml 02_cliente_servidor_threads
title Arquitetura 2: Cliente-Servidor com Threads (1 thread por cliente)

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor<<server>> #FFD966
  BackgroundColor<<thread>> #D9D2E9
  BackgroundColor<<client>> #9FC5E8
  BorderColor black
}

rectangle "SERVIDOR" as S <<server>> {
  rectangle "Thread 1" as T1 <<thread>>
  rectangle "Thread 2" as T2 <<thread>>
  rectangle "Thread 3" as T3 <<thread>>
}

rectangle "Cliente 1" as C1 <<client>>
rectangle "Cliente 2" as C2 <<client>>
rectangle "Cliente 3" as C3 <<client>>

T1 -down-> C1 : envia (paralelo)
T2 -down-> C2 : envia (paralelo)
T3 -down-> C3 : envia (paralelo)

note bottom of S
  Todas as threads rodam ao mesmo tempo.
  Tempo total ≈ tempo de 1 download
  (limitado pela banda do servidor)
end note

@enduml
